message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Two-Stage RAG System for Financial Filing Question Answering"
type: software
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-17"   # TODO: release date
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/snnmst/two-stage-rag-system"
# doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23433987" 
abstract: >-
  Research code and evaluation data for a two-stage retrieval-augmented generation
  cascade for question answering over SEC filings: a single-call extractor (System 1)
  escalates to a three-agent audit pipeline (System 2) when it signals insufficient
  evidence. Evaluated on the 150-question open-source FinanceBench sample.
keywords:
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - financial question answering
  - multi-agent systems
  - abstention
  - FinanceBench
